{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO FAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve been invited to an exclusive stay at the Beggars Hotel, a once-glamorous retreat where only the elite gather. But when the guests begin dying one by one, your dream getaway turns into a deadly game of survival. Who can you trust? Who is the killer? And most importantly\u2026 will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision shapes your fate. Unravel secrets, each character holds their own interactions that may lead to your demise. Uncover the truth before it\u2019s too late. With 8 unique endings, your actions will determine how your story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Choice-Driven Narrative \u2013 Every choice you make influences the story and your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple Endings \u2013 8 different conclusions based on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Intriguing Murder Mystery \u2013 Discover the secrets hidden within Beggars Hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Immersive Visual Novel Experience \u2013 Suspenseful storytelling with stunning visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mr. Manson is awaiting you\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you expose the killer before it\u2019s too late? Or will your fame be your downfall?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Friends!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070210/ed50ef1e4b3805d5bb4ddd63846072e90b931e06.jpg"},{"name":"No Time To Chat!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070210/ed50ef1e4b3805d5bb4ddd63846072e90b931e06.jpg"},{"name":"Love At First Sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070210/e709edbdaf898298d80feea5e0e0ee88f140e7c